========================================================================================
SYNTHESIS
========================================================================================
The lcm repair rows satisfy the full small-denominator sieve, but in the n=14,15,18 transfer tables they still remain positive-gap.  The focused endpoint audits of the largest lcm repairs are also terminal-core empty.
This separates two obstructions: missing a small denominator gives an immediate witness; covering it by a larger lcm gate exports the problem into endpoint debt rather than producing a cover.
